  Description: Barbarian, Thaumaturge Your body is accustomed to physical hardship
    and resistant to ailments. Your proficiency rank for Fortitude saves increases
    to master. When you roll a success on a Fortitude save, you get a critical success
    instead. Magus Your body is accustomed to physical hardship and resistant to
    a wide range of ailments. Your proficiency rank for Fortitude saves increases
